==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*10 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*20 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*1 [[The 6th Angel (Enemy)|The 6th Angel]] spawns as the boss after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

